WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:32.710 --> 01:33.920
What happened?

01:34.460 --> 01:35.420
Elie... She got...

01:35.630 --> 01:36.470
kidnapped.

01:36.730 --> 01:37.230
Eh?

01:38.430 --> 01:40.350
Bring the Rave to my castle

01:40.390 --> 01:43.430
by 5pm, which is two hours from now.

01:43.640 --> 01:47.660
If you are even a second
late, I will take this girl's life.

01:49.690 --> 01:51.230
Let's go, Plue!

01:51.360 --> 01:52.400
Wait, kid!

01:53.900 --> 01:56.670
Are you going try and fight
him with a broken sword?

01:56.860 --> 01:58.320
One hour from now!

01:58.660 --> 02:00.450
That will be my fight.

02:01.070 --> 02:05.870
I've never thought of fighting, not even once,

02:06.790 --> 02:10.750
but now I've realized the
fight I should have been in!

02:11.380 --> 02:11.850
Then...

02:13.840 --> 02:15.420
It's been fifteen years since I last fixed a sword...

02:16.340 --> 02:19.700
but once again and for the last time, I will fix...

02:19.800 --> 02:22.220
this precious sword... in the name of Musica!

02:22.640 --> 02:25.430
I will fix it with all of my strength and soul!

02:27.100 --> 02:27.930
Old man!

02:28.190 --> 02:33.650
Revival of the Ten Commandments!

02:40.610 --> 02:41.610
It's hot!

02:45.620 --> 02:47.950
Musica, will it be done in a hour?

02:59.720 --> 03:03.460
Don't rush me. It's been fifteen years...

03:03.970 --> 03:08.890
Besides, it usually takes more than
one day to fix a broken sword.

03:10.560 --> 03:15.390
But all I've been hearing is noise.
If you don't hurry, Elie will be...

03:15.860 --> 03:17.610
It's useless to be impatient.

03:17.780 --> 03:21.110
Without this sword, you won't be
able to defeat Lance's Beast sword.

03:24.410 --> 03:26.410
Lance's Beast sword.

03:26.700 --> 03:29.500
Don't worry. I'll have it done in time.

03:29.830 --> 03:33.460
I'm putting in a strong core, so
that it won't brake again.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.460
Core?

03:35.960 --> 03:37.170
That's right.

03:40.720 --> 03:43.840
If the core is strong, it can never be broken...

03:47.390 --> 03:49.810
Which holds true for humans and swords alike...

03:57.900 --> 03:59.820
I see. Core...

04:00.440 --> 04:02.950
But Plue's nose breaks so easily though..

04:03.990 --> 04:05.660
Because its core is weak.

04:05.690 --> 04:07.480
First of all, does it even have a core?

04:10.160 --> 04:12.080
Anyway, you can count on me.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.430
What happened to this place?

04:32.520 --> 04:34.560
This is what the Demon Card did.

04:34.980 --> 04:37.360
They have already started it...

04:39.440 --> 04:42.570
We have to hurry.

04:44.240 --> 04:44.850
Shiba!

04:49.700 --> 04:51.330
Ha-Haru!

04:54.010 --> 04:54.700
Kenma?

04:57.920 --> 04:59.630
I have something important to tell you.

05:02.760 --> 05:03.780
Listen...

05:04.010 --> 05:05.010
Your wound is deep.

05:05.130 --> 05:06.220
Don't talk right now.

05:08.010 --> 05:09.390
I must tell you...

05:10.720 --> 05:11.930
...it's about your father,

05:12.350 --> 05:13.680
Gale...

05:14.560 --> 05:15.440
My dad?

05:16.530 --> 05:20.940
Haru, the reason why your father,
Gale, left this island was...

05:22.150 --> 05:25.450
...to find Rave.

05:25.780 --> 05:26.740
Rave?

05:27.910 --> 05:28.750
Really?

05:28.780 --> 05:30.130
Is this true, sis?

05:33.950 --> 05:37.460
Gale didn't abandon you guys.

05:38.580 --> 05:43.960
Fifteen years ago, Gale left
this island to find Rave...

05:44.300 --> 05:47.180
...in order to destroy the Dark Bring completely.

05:47.680 --> 05:48.590
Dad...

06:00.480 --> 06:02.070
Now I see.

06:03.230 --> 06:08.200
The reason our dad left us here,
was to find Rave.

06:09.450 --> 06:11.140
He left our mom, too.

06:15.790 --> 06:18.000
But I kinda understand...

06:18.290 --> 06:22.090
If they do more bad things
others towns will be destroyed.

06:27.380 --> 06:31.510
And if that was the case, a lot of
kids would lose their families...

06:31.640 --> 06:34.010
And they will be sad and that's not right.

06:39.980 --> 06:41.190
Sis!

06:50.530 --> 06:53.320
Plue, what should I do?

07:09.050 --> 07:09.840
Elie...

07:10.050 --> 07:11.180
Hang on.

07:29.650 --> 07:31.910
What the hell is he doing?

07:31.950 --> 07:33.780
We've only got thirty minutes left.

07:34.120 --> 07:37.120
After all, wasn't that old man a fake?

07:39.540 --> 07:41.960
Hey you. What are you doing here?

07:43.170 --> 07:44.540
I'm waiting for someone.

07:45.540 --> 07:46.800
Yo-you!

07:47.550 --> 07:49.770
Musica of the Silver Rhythm!

07:50.300 --> 07:52.630
You came to destroy us?

07:53.260 --> 07:54.300
I don't know.

07:54.680 --> 07:56.100
Invader!

08:00.140 --> 08:01.270
Damn you.

08:01.980 --> 08:03.710
What was that noise?

08:08.320 --> 08:09.730
Should I go in first?

08:32.380 --> 08:35.220
Musica of the Silver Rhythm...

08:37.220 --> 08:38.810
What a guy...

08:40.340 --> 08:41.180
Hey...

08:43.100 --> 08:46.160
I said let's do a word game.

08:46.190 --> 08:47.530
Why are you ignoring me?

08:51.650 --> 08:53.700
Then I'm going first, ok?

08:53.900 --> 08:56.450
First of all, um...

08:56.950 --> 08:57.450
Plue!

08:58.990 --> 09:02.950
With this word, either P or L is fine.

09:08.380 --> 09:09.910
You are annoying.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.090
I'm sorry.

09:13.470 --> 09:14.760
Bitch!

09:14.920 --> 09:18.430
You don't understand the
situation you're in, huh?

09:18.800 --> 09:19.730
Because...

09:19.760 --> 09:22.020
I'm bored being like this!

09:22.310 --> 09:24.640
Then, do you want me to kill you now?

09:24.890 --> 09:27.520
That... That's not what you promised!

09:27.770 --> 09:29.400
You said you were going wait two hours first.

09:29.730 --> 09:31.300
It's the same outcome

09:31.330 --> 09:32.820
whether it's now or it's later

09:32.860 --> 09:37.410
you and that Rave Master will perish!

09:37.990 --> 09:38.990
Haru won't...

09:40.280 --> 09:42.490
Haru won't be defeated so easily.

09:45.500 --> 09:46.920
That's good...

09:46.960 --> 09:52.420
Because it's so exhilarating cutting
a guy like that into pieces.

10:00.050 --> 10:02.140
I want to cut him now!

10:06.310 --> 10:07.280
Good.

10:07.310 --> 10:08.650
Looks like you're alive.

10:09.310 --> 10:11.310
You're the one from earlier...

10:12.690 --> 10:14.480
Hey, you horny old man!

10:14.570 --> 10:16.320
I came to get Elie back.

10:16.540 --> 10:17.350
Musica!

10:19.740 --> 10:22.080
That's the same name as that drunk old man.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.330
Elie.

10:23.330 --> 10:25.580
Did this pervert do any horny things to you?

10:25.700 --> 10:28.250
Yeah, he touched my breasts.

10:28.280 --> 10:29.080
What?!

10:29.750 --> 10:30.920
You bitch!

10:30.960 --> 10:32.840
Sorry... I'm just kidding.

10:33.170 --> 10:36.510
Don't be so angry, sheesh.

10:36.880 --> 10:38.760
I have no business with you.

10:39.470 --> 10:41.720
Where is the Rave Master?

10:43.510 --> 10:47.480
Looks like I'm not well liked around here.

10:48.560 --> 10:52.070
Lance, what the hell is going on?

10:52.110 --> 10:55.190
When I came back, I found
all the soldiers beaten up.

10:55.570 --> 10:57.220
Huh? What?!

10:57.320 --> 10:59.240
These are the kids from earlier.

10:59.320 --> 11:00.950
Are you guys the ones who did it?

11:01.360 --> 11:02.160
Beast!

11:02.200 --> 11:04.450
Where the hell were you until now?

11:04.660 --> 11:13.460
N-no.. Old... Old man was... Rave... Rave
is... that's because of... well... umm...

11:14.000 --> 11:15.630
What the hell did you just say?

11:15.670 --> 11:17.210
Somebody, interpret that for me.

11:18.590 --> 11:20.970
Because Rave went boom and the...

11:21.050 --> 11:22.550
That's enough, Beast!

11:22.840 --> 11:25.470
Anyway, finish this boy off!

11:26.370 --> 11:27.440
Yes.

11:27.720 --> 11:30.140
Hey, bring Cranky out here!

11:30.310 --> 11:31.560
Yes sir!

11:32.230 --> 11:34.900
I have to beat up this fatass first?

11:36.690 --> 11:37.700
What did you

11:37.730 --> 11:39.610
just say?

11:40.980 --> 11:41.820
Oh no...

11:41.860 --> 11:44.740
That word is taboo for Beast.

11:44.780 --> 11:46.720
N-no... Don't say anything else!

11:49.950 --> 11:51.620
You don't like being called fatso, huh?

11:51.830 --> 11:54.170
Then how about just pig?

11:55.250 --> 11:57.590
Even if you compliment me now, it's still too late.

11:58.050 --> 11:59.920
Oh no, I wasn't complimenting you.

11:59.960 --> 12:00.840
Shut the fuck up!

12:03.890 --> 12:05.010
I'll kill you!

12:05.300 --> 12:06.760
What is that?!

12:07.220 --> 12:08.470
That's so uncool...

12:26.320 --> 12:29.450
I'll show you the treat of a Crankyman!

12:29.540 --> 12:31.450
Your body won't stay in one piece for long!

12:39.430 --> 12:39.800
Eh?

12:39.800 --> 12:40.920
A little slow?

12:42.720 --> 12:45.640
Damn you bastard! Die!

12:50.680 --> 12:52.230
You're boring me!

12:52.480 --> 12:54.940
Cool! You are pretty good!

12:55.150 --> 12:56.730
What the hell is he?

12:56.860 --> 13:00.690
Beast equipped with Crankyman
and is being treated like a child...

13:12.160 --> 13:13.540
This is interesting.

13:30.850 --> 13:32.640
Hurry up, Musica!

13:34.480 --> 13:36.420
I told you to be patient!

13:36.690 --> 13:41.460
If I don't have that, I won't be able to
defeat Lance's Beast sword, right?

13:41.570 --> 13:42.690
That's right.

13:42.980 --> 13:46.910
That's why I've been striking it with all my soul.

13:58.750 --> 14:01.040
I said you're boring me, fatso.

14:01.800 --> 14:03.250
Shit, you bastard!

14:16.640 --> 14:19.190
Your time is up.

14:20.980 --> 14:22.020
Bastard!

14:22.440 --> 14:24.110
He was your comrade...

14:24.140 --> 14:25.360
My comrade?

14:26.510 --> 14:28.660
You mean this useless pawn?

14:28.910 --> 14:29.910
Seems like

14:29.950 --> 14:32.420
your nerves are rotten.

14:33.830 --> 14:36.120
My sword tastes fresh.

14:37.370 --> 14:40.000
It's going to be fun killing you!

14:54.100 --> 14:55.350
Hurry up...

14:55.720 --> 14:57.060
There's no time left.

14:57.890 --> 14:58.480
Haru...

14:59.520 --> 15:05.280
I was living happily with my family
before I quit being a blacksmith.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.690
What is this suddenly?

15:08.530 --> 15:09.610
But...

15:09.650 --> 15:14.990
It was the beginning of my desperation
when I made Lance a sword.

15:15.500 --> 15:16.780
For La...Lance?

15:19.710 --> 15:22.710
He killed my whole family...

15:23.250 --> 15:25.810
With the sword that I've made for him...

15:25.880 --> 15:27.760
What?!

15:28.050 --> 15:29.550
My sword killed...

15:30.680 --> 15:32.590
My family...

15:49.240 --> 15:52.490
I'm sorry, but your sword is done now.

15:54.410 --> 15:55.990
Take it and go.

16:03.540 --> 16:04.970
This is a great sword!

16:05.840 --> 16:06.630
Haru...

16:08.250 --> 16:09.050
Please...

16:10.590 --> 16:12.840
Destroy that accursed...

16:14.680 --> 16:16.140
sword for me!

16:27.570 --> 16:30.610
To fix a sword is a blacksmith's duty.

16:32.900 --> 16:34.910
Musica fought really well.

16:37.620 --> 16:39.450
From now on, it's my turn.

16:39.950 --> 16:41.620
The Rave Master's duty!

16:45.500 --> 16:46.380
You can count on me!

16:47.040 --> 16:48.380
I will defeat him!

16:56.090 --> 16:59.100
Well, shall we begin, old man?

17:00.140 --> 17:01.520
I'll show you...

17:01.600 --> 17:03.810
The power of my beast sword.

17:10.190 --> 17:11.940
Not this again!

17:11.980 --> 17:13.700
I already saw through this!

17:13.820 --> 17:15.820
It's just an illusion!

17:16.660 --> 17:17.870
It's not that easy!

17:19.750 --> 17:20.460
Musica!

17:28.040 --> 17:29.380
I barely cut him.

17:30.590 --> 17:31.890
I see.

17:31.920 --> 17:34.670
That illusion was meant to blind me.

17:38.640 --> 17:40.430
It's been a long time since I've felt like this...

17:45.230 --> 17:46.640
What the hell are you doing?

17:46.980 --> 17:48.730
Our fight has barely begun...

17:49.810 --> 17:51.270
I'll go for real this time.

17:51.520 --> 17:53.820
Before that, I have something to do.

17:57.200 --> 17:59.030
Hey, what are you going do?

18:01.870 --> 18:05.210
Your wounds opened up because you shouted, fool!

18:07.210 --> 18:10.380
I've been meticulous for some time now.

18:12.500 --> 18:15.090
I'm very punctual about time.

18:21.600 --> 18:23.010
It's 5pm.

18:23.810 --> 18:26.350
I have to kill this girls now!

18:26.600 --> 18:28.810
What? No!

18:30.400 --> 18:32.360
You're joking, right?

18:33.900 --> 18:34.860
Stop it!

18:38.490 --> 18:39.860
You are so noisy...

18:40.570 --> 18:43.450
I've been waiting for this moment.

18:44.790 --> 18:47.270
The moment that I can cut another human!

18:49.080 --> 18:50.290
Die!

18:57.760 --> 18:59.760
Haru!

19:07.100 --> 19:08.640
Are you okay, Elie?

19:13.020 --> 19:14.980
Haru! You're late!

19:16.690 --> 19:18.490
What kind of entrance is that?

19:18.740 --> 19:21.200
Why the hell is that sword so huge?!

19:21.240 --> 19:23.910
Can a boy like him really swing that huge sword?!

19:24.280 --> 19:25.120
Yeah.

19:25.200 --> 19:26.750
Of course, I can swing it!

19:29.410 --> 19:31.250
Lance's sword was repelled by it!

19:37.340 --> 19:40.260
Whenever I see him, I also become energetic.

19:41.890 --> 19:43.300
I've been waiting for you.

19:43.390 --> 19:45.010
Rave Master.

19:46.470 --> 19:48.930
Plue, you came, too. Thank you.

19:49.310 --> 19:51.690
You put Elie in danger.

19:51.850 --> 19:53.770
I won't forgive you, old man!

19:54.020 --> 19:57.730
Oh, so that's the famous Ten Commandments.

19:58.030 --> 20:00.490
Haru! This guy is mine.

20:00.860 --> 20:02.410
I haven't felt exhilarated like this for a long time.

20:02.570 --> 20:03.950
Don't interrupt me!

20:03.990 --> 20:04.990
No way.

20:05.490 --> 20:06.620
What?!

20:07.010 --> 20:09.620
He is the one whom I have to defeat!

20:11.080 --> 20:12.540
With the other Musica...

20:12.710 --> 20:15.590
The blacksmith, I made a promise.

20:16.540 --> 20:17.960
I will defeat this guy...

20:18.420 --> 20:19.090
No...

20:22.050 --> 20:23.640
This sword will defeat him!

20:23.990 --> 20:24.820
Haru...

20:25.220 --> 20:27.930
What the hell are you guys talking about?

20:28.220 --> 20:30.890
I'll kill you both, so don't worry.

20:34.190 --> 20:35.900
Fool! Don't rush in!

20:41.610 --> 20:43.950
The illusion disappeared?!

20:47.700 --> 20:50.500
Every time you swing the sword, the beast appears...

20:51.330 --> 20:52.540
The beast sword...

20:52.830 --> 20:54.620
That's his weapon.

20:54.710 --> 20:55.830
The beast sword?!

20:56.130 --> 20:57.420
I'll tell you...

20:57.750 --> 21:00.050
His sword's weak point!

21:00.380 --> 21:03.260
I heard it from the man who made your sword!

21:03.930 --> 21:07.300
If you don't swing it all the way
down, the illusion won't appear!

21:07.720 --> 21:10.200
Musica The Blacksmith, huh?

21:10.350 --> 21:14.440
I see. That's why you went and repelled it
from the bottom with your sword...

21:14.480 --> 21:15.600
Cool!

21:17.650 --> 21:20.820
So, if I stop your sword from
swinging down, completely...

21:21.940 --> 21:23.380
You can't use your trick!

21:27.660 --> 21:30.490
You've studied me quite well.

21:31.270 --> 21:32.470
However...

21:32.660 --> 21:36.250
Do you really know
everything about my sword?

21:43.630 --> 21:45.590
Wha-what's happening?

21:45.720 --> 21:47.940
He didn't swing the sword,
but the illusion appeared!

21:50.390 --> 21:52.440
It's just a beginning now.

21:52.470 --> 21:55.830
I will kill you for sure, Rave Master!

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're wings on my heart kono negai haruka na yume no shijima ni tokete

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:42.200 --> 23:43.470
What's wrong, Haru?

23:43.510 --> 23:45.130
You look like you're having
a hard time fighting him.

23:45.640 --> 23:46.230
Shut up!

23:46.600 --> 23:48.710
You almost got beaten up too.

23:48.780 --> 23:52.120
Hey, you guys, this is not the time to argue!

23:52.280 --> 23:53.340
That's right.

23:53.740 --> 23:56.290
For the old man's sake, I have to
defeat the beast swordsman, Lance.

23:58.350 --> 23:59.820
On the next episode of Rave!

23:59.880 --> 24:02.600
Confrontation of Musica's two swords!

24:03.070 --> 24:04.320
I will win!
